  "plain": "Roughly two weeks after the 1947 Roswell incident, when something crashed near Roswell, New Mexico, the US passed the National Security Act of 1947, the law that created the Air Force and the CIA at the same moment. That is the point made by Jake Barber, a former helicopter pilot who says he flew a UFO recovery mission, talking to Jesse Michels. He offers the timing as a hint that the new security setup was shaped by what was found at Roswell."
